    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game contains flashing lights. They can be disabled in the Options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the infamous<strong><i> Purple Shirt Guy</i></strong>\u00a0known throughout the entire world of Face Invaders, in this HIGH-SPEED-action-packed-score-attack-precision-based arcade game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/69a0f10f703394dc0513366dc45f0f41.avif?t=1741051438\" width=190 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the most dangerous aliens ever to invade the planet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/6f77abec957b83c1ecc167cff3a5558e.avif?t=1741051438\" width=380 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FACES!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your strange powers to defeat them, before they overwhelm you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/7e5bc02381c73d1ab0367b0b2de1057c.avif?t=1741051438\" width=426 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other watching, and they won't tolerate your actions for long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is my very first game!</strong>\u00a0Please be nice :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game and all the assets, including the soundtrack, myself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may update this game in the future with more levels and some bosses too!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game contains flashing lights. They can be disabled in the Options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the infamous<strong><i> Purple Shirt Guy</i></strong>\u00a0known throughout the entire world of Face Invaders, in this HIGH-SPEED-action-packed-score-attack-precision-based arcade game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/69a0f10f703394dc0513366dc45f0f41.avif?t=1741051438\" width=190 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the most dangerous aliens ever to invade the planet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/6f77abec957b83c1ecc167cff3a5558e.avif?t=1741051438\" width=380 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FACES!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your strange powers to defeat them, before they overwhelm you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/7e5bc02381c73d1ab0367b0b2de1057c.avif?t=1741051438\" width=426 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other watching, and they won't tolerate your actions for long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is my very first game!</strong>\u00a0Please be nice :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game and all the assets, including the soundtrack, myself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may update this game in the future with more levels and some bosses too!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "An arcade style score-attack game that takes place in the universe of Purple Shirt Guy. Shoot or dodge the Face Invaders, and try to get the highest score possible. Beware of Full-Body generals! They don't like you taking out their minions...",
